nters the Novelist's home.\nShe plans to re-enact a grim crime from one of her novels.\n\nNovelist is bound & disguised exactly like the victim in the novel.\nClothes removed first. Then, disguise applied.\n\nOptional:\nThe fan also restrains herself. Time-sensitive trap for both.\n\nhttps://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/427/article/924929", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tripleq_did/works/223", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/91b83490/uploads/origins/e1834e2f-1750-444d-bf35-3de15683f621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25d057175d8af6d2f331190f938ead43", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/91b83490/uploads/origins/e1834e2f-1750-444d-bf35-3de15683f621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25d057175d8af6d2f331190f938ead43, https://si.imgix.net/91b83490/uploads/origins/e1834e2f-1750-444d-bf35-3de15683f621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24ce5933decd9ffed1cbab16a073a167 2x, https://si.imgix.net/91b83490/uploads/origins/e1834e2f-1750-444d-bf35-3de15683f621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2049bebfc7d799ec30a1ca51a774607c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "犯罪組織への潜入中に正体が露見して捕らえられた「向江律」を、（元）後輩の「今種馴亜」が救出しにきて、律が更なるピンチ（笑）に陥るシーンをお願いできないでしょうか。\n馴亜が律の後輩だった頃か、交通部に異動した後かはお任せします。ただ、律の服装のみ、脱出ゲーム中で着用していた服装でお願いしたいです。\nお手数をお掛けしますが、ご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tripleq_did/works/222", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4231d719/uploads/origins/515ad93d-f375-4a90-b829-8d9d92f90b7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6cd17f5f36f8d815c6d588462b598f9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4231d719/uploads/origins/515ad93d-f375-4a90-b829-8d9d92f90b7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h