で結構です、難しそうなら無視してください）", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tripleq_did/works/209", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/10b7c67a/uploads/origins/03fff62b-44b1-4771-afe7-59058b75f505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=365707aa03b350289aea44bd9005c4ee", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/10b7c67a/uploads/origins/03fff62b-44b1-4771-afe7-59058b75f505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=365707aa03b350289aea44bd9005c4ee, https://si.imgix.net/10b7c67a/uploads/origins/03fff62b-44b1-4771-afe7-59058b75f505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eaa76291ae529860996136f95f77a292 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10b7c67a/uploads/origins/03fff62b-44b1-4771-afe7-59058b75f505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8400d28e05948b7a859e2b7795022fdd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Mouth-sew has a new \"boyfriend\"\nFemale teacher or detective is chosen\n\n- Outfit removed\n- Lingerie removed. Sports bra added\n- Crotch wire/rope & toy\n- Male student outfit\n\n- Lingerie/pantyhose stuffing\n- Skin-colored tape wrap\n- [Optional] Folded sock\n\n- Black mask\n- Hair tied into short hair\n- Cap", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}